&trento; monitors your system health and validates your setup against &suse; and &sap;
best practices. The state of your &sap; landscape is available through the &trento; Web
console, &trento; API or &trento; Model Context Protocol (&mcp;) server.

&selnx; includes &sap;-specific policies to help secure the &sap; landscape. Pre-built
&s4sa; 16 public cloud images are hardened using security profiles based on &cisa;
benchmarks and &disaa; &stiga;.
